 "description": "CaaS (Context as a Service): Aggregates real-time on-chain signals into a structured context brief for agent decision-making. Intents: swap (gas+price+whales), bridge (multi-chain gas), invest (yields+trending), monitor (whales+gas), general (all signals). No LLM cost \u2014 pure data. Use at the start of a swap, bridge, invest, monitor, or general workflow to collect the relevant signals in one structured brief. Use focused tools when the agent already knows the exact data it needs.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
